s</article-title><source>EMBO J.</source><volume>8</volume><year>1989</year><fpage>1341</fpage><lpage>1348</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2527741</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="BretscherandAguado-Velasco1998"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bretscher</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Aguado-Velasco</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Membrane traffic during cell locomotion</article-title><source>Curr. Opin. Cell Biol.</source><volume>10</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>537</fpage><lpage>541</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9719876</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Burridgeetal1990"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burridge</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nuckolls</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Otey</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pavalko</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Simon</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Actin-membrane interaction in focal adhesions</article-title><source>Cell Differ. Dev.</source><volume>32</volume><year>1990</year><fpage>337</fpage><lpage>342</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2129156</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Caoetal1998"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cao</surname><given-names>Z.</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Horwitz</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identification of a domain on the integrin alpha5 subunit implicated in cell spreading and signaling</article-title><source>J. Biol. Chem.</source><volume>273</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>31670</fpage><lpage>31679</lpa